<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa to Kansai Elec bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa to Kansai Elec bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday that it had assigned its Aaa rating to Kansai Electric Power Co Inc's 60 billion yen worth of 3.175 percent bonds due 2017.</p>
<p>The rating is based on Kansai Electric's importance to the Japanese economy and the very favourable industry operating environment, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
